from lesson_data import P,S,E,Q,finish
LESSON=finish(dict(number=13,prereqs=[4,7,8],lead=P("Treat a program as structured input: recognise strings, parse expressions and evaluate syntax trees. Then distinguish hard problems from impossible general algorithms.","把程序视为结构化输入：识别字符串、解析表达式并求值语法树，再区分困难问题与不存在通用算法的问题。"),before=P("Know recursion, proofs and complexity. The interpreter recognises only its stated small grammar; it never calls Python eval.","了解递归、证明与复杂度。解释器仅识别规定的小语法，不调用 Python eval。"),outcomes=[P("Model a finite automaton.","建模有限自动机。"),P("Separate lexing, parsing and evaluation.","区分词法、解析与求值。"),P("Explain precedence with a grammar.","通过文法解释优先级。"),P("Outline the halting contradiction.","概述停机问题矛盾证明。"),P("Distinguish P, NP and undecidability.","区分 P、NP 与不可判定。")],sections=[
S("Languages and finite automata","语言与有限自动机","<p>A formal language is a set of strings over an alphabet. A deterministic finite automaton has states, a start state, a transition for each symbol and accepting states. For binary strings with an even count of ones, use even and odd states: zero keeps the state; one toggles it; accept even. Empty input is accepted. Finite memory suffices for parity, but arbitrary balanced parentheses require an unbounded nesting count or stack, which a finite automaton cannot generally provide.</p>","<p>形式语言是字母表上字符串的集合。确定有限自动机包含状态、初始状态、每符号转移与接受状态。偶数个一的二进制串可用偶奇两状态，零不变、一切换，接受偶。空串接受。奇偶仅需有限记忆，但任意平衡括号需要无界嵌套计数或栈，有限自动机一般无法提供。</p>","What state follows 101?","101 后是哪状态？","Even: two ones toggle twice.","偶，两次一切换两次。"),
S("Tokens, grammar and syntax trees","词法、文法与语法树","<p>Lexing groups characters into tokens such as integers and operators. Parsing checks how tokens fit a grammar and constructs a syntax tree. Our grammar is expression=term ('+' term)*; term=factor ('*' factor)*; factor=integer or '(' expression ')'. Multiplication binds tighter because terms absorb products before expressions combine sums. The tree for 2+3*4 is +(2,*(3,4)), not *(+(2,3),4). A parser must consume the entire input; accepting a valid prefix while ignoring extra tokens is a bug.</p>","<p>词法把字符分为整数、运算符等记号，解析按文法构建语法树。文法为表达式含加法项，项含乘法因子，因子为整数或括号表达式。项先吸收乘法，所以乘法优先。2+3*4 的树为 +(2,*(3,4))，不是 *(+(2,3),4)。解析必须消耗全部输入，不能忽略尾部记号。</p>","Why does 2+3*4 evaluate to 14?","为何 2+3*4 得十四？","The grammar groups 3*4 as one term before addition.","文法先把三乘四作为一项。"),
S("Interpreters and compilers","解释器与编译器","<p>An interpreter executes the meaning of a representation; a compiler translates it to another representation. An AST evaluator recursively computes child values and applies their operator. Syntax validity is distinct from semantic validity: a language with division could parse 1/0 yet fail during evaluation. Real language systems may compile to bytecode and then interpret or JIT-compile it, so the categories can coexist. Error reports should identify whether tokenisation, structure or execution failed.</p>","<p>解释器执行表示的含义，编译器转换到另一表示。AST 求值递归计算子值再应用运算。语法有效不同于语义有效，带除法语言可解析 1/0 却求值失败。真实系统可编译字节码再解释或即时编译，因此类别可共存。错误需区分词法、结构与执行阶段。</p>","Is a successful parse proof that evaluation will succeed?","解析成功证明求值成功吗？","No; semantic errors may remain.","不是，仍可能有语义错误。"),
S("Computability and the halting problem","可计算性与停机问题","<p>A decision procedure must return yes or no and terminate for every valid input. Suppose H(P,x) always decides whether program P halts on input x. Construct D(P): if H(P,P) says halts, loop forever; otherwise halt. Ask what D(D) does. If H says it halts, D loops; if H says it loops, D halts. Either answer contradicts H's claimed correctness. Therefore no such general halting decider exists in a computational model able to express this construction.</p><p>This does not forbid proving termination for particular programs, or deciding restricted finite systems. A time limit is not a general decider: exceeding it cannot distinguish a long terminating run from an infinite one.</p>","<p>判定过程需对每个有效输入终止并回答是或否。假设 H(P,x) 总能判定 P 在 x 上是否停机。构造 D(P)：若 H(P,P) 说停，则永远循环，否则停机。考察 D(D)：H 说停则循环，说循环则停，两种都矛盾，因此能表达该构造的计算模型中不存在通用停机判定器。</p><p>仍可证明特定程序终止，或判定受限有限系统。超时不是通用判定，不能区分很久后终止与无限运行。</p>","Can a timeout prove a general program never halts?","超时能证明一般程序永不停吗？","No; it may halt after the timeout.","不能，可能超时后终止。"),
S("P, NP and reductions","P、NP 与归约","<p>P contains decision problems solvable in polynomial time in encoded input length. NP contains decision problems whose yes answers have polynomial-sized certificates verifiable in polynomial time. NP does not mean 'not polynomial', and P is contained in NP. For a route-length decision problem, a proposed route can serve as a certificate under suitable bounds. NP-complete problems are in NP and every NP problem reduces to them in polynomial time. A reduction maps instances while preserving yes/no answers. P versus NP remains open; NP-hardness differs fundamentally from undecidability.</p>","<p>P 是对编码长度多项式时间可解的判定问题，NP 的是答案具有多项式大小证书并可多项式验证。NP 不是非多项式，P 包含于 NP。路线判定在合适界下可用路线作证书。NP 完全问题属于 NP，且每个 NP 问题可多项式归约到它。归约保持是非答案。P 与 NP 仍未解决，NP 难不同于不可判定。</p>","Does NP mean no polynomial-time algorithm exists?","NP 意味着不存在多项式算法吗？","No; P⊆NP, and P versus NP is unresolved.","不，P⊆NP，P 与 NP 关系仍未解决。")],
labs=[dict(file="m13_automaton.py",title=P("Recognise a language","识别语言"),intro=P("A two-state machine accepts even parity and rejects symbols outside its alphabet.","两状态机器接受偶奇偶性并拒绝字母表外符号。"),tasks=P("<ol><li>Change acceptance to odd parity.</li><li>Draw the transition table.</li><li>Add a second state component for whether any zero has appeared.</li></ol>","<ol><li>改为接受奇数。</li><li>画转移表。</li><li>增加是否出现零的状态。</li></ol>"),solution=P("<p>Accept state 1 for odd parity, making empty input reject. On 0, both parity states stay; on 1, they swap. A seen-zero Boolean combines with parity into at most four states.</p>","<p>接受状态一则空串拒绝。零保持、一切换，出现零布尔值与奇偶组合最多四状态。</p>")),dict(file="m13_interpreter.py",title=P("An expression interpreter","表达式解释器"),intro=P("Trace tokenisation, AST construction and evaluation separately. Input length and nesting are bounded.","分别跟踪词法、AST 构造与求值，并限制输入与嵌套。"),tasks=P("<ol><li>Evaluate 2*(3+4*5).</li><li>Try unmatched parentheses and trailing tokens.</li><li>Design subtraction's grammar and evaluation while preserving left associativity.</li></ol>","<ol><li>计算 2*(3+4*5)。</li><li>尝试不匹配括号与尾部记号。</li><li>设计减法并保留左结合。</li></ol>"),solution=P("<p>The value is 46. Syntax errors are rejected before evaluation. Add '-' to tokens and the expression loop; build ('-',old,right) each step and evaluate subtraction explicitly. 10−3−2 must mean (10−3)−2=5.</p>","<p>结果四十六，语法错求值前拒绝。加入减号记号与表达式循环，每次构建旧左树减右项，显式处理减法。十减三减二应左结合为五。</p>"))],
exercises=[E(1,"DFA","自动机","Does 1111 pass the even-one machine?","1111 接受吗？","<p>Yes, four toggles return to even.</p>","<p>是，四次切换回偶。</p>"),E(1,"AST","语法树","Give the tree for (2+3)*4.","给 (2+3)*4 的树。","<p>('*', ('+',2,3),4); its value is 20.</p>","<p>乘法根、加法左子树、四右子树，值二十。</p>"),E(2,"Prefix acceptance","前缀接受","Why reject '2 3' rather than return 2?","为何拒绝 '2 3' 而非返回二？","<p>It contains unconsumed tokens; the contract accepts complete expressions, not valid prefixes.</p>","<p>有未消耗记号，约定接受完整表达式而非前缀。</p>"),E(2,"Semantic error","语义错误","Give an expression syntactically valid but failing in a language with integer division.","给带整数除法语言中语法有效但求值失败例子。","<p>1/0 can fit the grammar but division by zero is invalid.</p>","<p>1/0 可符合文法但除零无效。</p>"),E(2,"Finite restrictions","有限限制","Can a machine recognise balanced parentheses with depth at most two?","机器可识别最多两层平衡括号吗？","<p>Yes, finite states for depths 0,1,2 plus rejection suffice. The unbounded version needs unbounded memory.</p>","<p>可以，深度零一二加拒绝状态足够，无界版本需无界记忆。</p>"),E(3,"Halting contradiction","停机矛盾","Explain both cases of D(D) in the assumed halting decider proof.","解释停机证明 D(D) 的两种情况。","<p>If H predicts halt, D follows the loop branch and does not halt. If H predicts no halt, D returns. Both contradict the prediction, so the universal H cannot exist.</p>","<p>预测停则 D 循环，预测不停则 D 返回，双方矛盾，故通用 H 不存在。</p>"),E(3,"Certificate","证书","For 'is there a simple route using at most k edges?', describe a certificate verifier.","对至多 k 边简单路线判定，描述证书验证。","<p>Check listed endpoints, no repeated vertex, each consecutive edge exists and length≤k. A simple route has at most V vertices, giving a polynomial certificate and verification.</p>","<p>检查端点、不重复顶点、连续边存在与长度界；简单路线最多 V 顶点，证书与验证多项式。</p>"),E(2,"Limits","边界","Distinguish NP-complete from undecidable.","区分 NP 完全与不可判定。","<p>NP-complete problems have polynomial verifiers and can be decided by finite exhaustive search, though no general polynomial solution is known. Undecidable problems have no total correct general decision procedure in the model.</p>","<p>NP 完全有多项式验证且可有限穷举判定，但未知通用多项式解；不可判定没有模型中的全正确通用判定过程。</p>")],
quiz=[Q("Lexing produces?","词法产生什么？","Tokens","记号","Network packets","网络包","Only final values","仅最终值","Parsing consumes tokens into structure.","解析从记号构造结构。"),Q("Why multiplication binds tighter?","乘法为何优先？","The grammar groups it within terms","文法把它组合在项内","Python eval is used","使用 eval","It is always faster","总更快","Grammar defines precedence.","文法定义优先级。"),Q("An interpreter must use eval?","解释器必须用 eval 吗？","No","不必","Always","必须","Only for integers","仅整数","Explicit AST evaluation suffices.","显式 AST 求值足够。"),Q("The halting result forbids?","停机结论禁止什么？","A correct total decider for all programs","对所有程序全正确判定器","Every termination proof","所有终止证明","Finite-state analysis","有限状态分析","Specific restricted cases can be solved.","受限具体情况仍可解。"),Q("NP stands for?","NP 表示什么？","Nondeterministic polynomial time","非确定多项式时间","Not polynomial","非多项式","No programs","没有程序","It also has a polynomial-verifier characterisation.","也具有多项式验证刻画。"),Q("P versus NP is?","P 与 NP 是什么状态？","Unresolved","未解决","Proved equal","已证相等","Proved disjoint","已证不相交","P is a subset of NP; equality is open.","P 是 NP 子集，相等性开放。")],pitfalls=[P("Parsing is not the same as executing arbitrary host-language code.","解析不同于执行任意宿主语言代码。"),P("Undecidable and computationally expensive are different claims.","不可判定与计算昂贵是不同结论。")],reading=[(P("MIT computation course","MIT 计算理论课程"),"https://ocw.mit.edu/courses/18-404j-theory-of-computation-fall-2020/",P("Read the automata, undecidability and complexity lecture summaries; keep the three notions separate.","阅读自动机、不可判定与复杂度概要，区分三者。"))],terms=[(P("Grammar","文法"),P("Rules for valid syntactic structure.","有效语法结构规则。")),(P("Decider","判定器"),P("A procedure returning a correct yes/no answer and halting on every valid input.","对每个有效输入终止并给正确是非答案的过程。")),(P("Reduction","归约"),P("A transformation preserving the decision answer between problems.","在问题间保持判定答案的转换。"))],review=P("<p>Draw the AST before evaluating and explain the halting contradiction from memory. Module 14 combines the series into a tested catalogue application.</p>","<p>求值前画 AST，凭记忆解释停机矛盾。模块 14 将整合为测试过的目录应用。</p>")))
